Its form is forced by `charge = reducedCharge + 6*carry`. -/
def horizontalFluxWith (charge : Nat → Int) (S i : Nat) : Int :=
  charge (base4Digit S i) -
    4 * reducedChargeWith charge (base4Digit S (i+1))

